      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹20.03 (vs ₹17.58 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹20.03 (up from ₹17.58 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹5.20b (up 15% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹579.2m (up 14% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 11% (in line with FY 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 14% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 3% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
