      "date": "2026-02-05T12:16:15.000Z",
      "title": "Dividend of ₹1.00 announced",
      "body": "Dividend of ₹1.00 is the same as last year. Ex-date: 6th February 2026 Payment date: 5th March 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.7%, which is lower than the industry average of 0.8%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is covered by earnings (23% earnings payout ratio) but the company has no free cash flows available, indicating it may be using cash reserves or debt to pay the dividend. The dividend has increased by an average of 10% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. Earnings per share has remained steady over the last 5 years. Unless this trend deteriorates, it should provide adequate earnings cover for the dividend.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
