      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹6.73 (vs ₹6.66 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹6.73 (up from ₹6.66 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.41b (up 15% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹194.5m (up 1.1% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 14% (down from 16% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 13% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 4% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
